## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear provides audio visual rental for religious events in Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol: a lectern or wireless microphone for the officiant, PA sound, and a screen for readings. Backed by experience going back to 1996, we deliver, install and test the equipment so your service runs without a technical distraction.

Contact us today to discuss your event.

## Key Highlights

---

Malaga Event Gear provides audio visual rental for religious events in Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol.

