## What We Provide, and What We Don't

We provide PA sound sized to the room, a gooseneck or wireless microphone depending on the package, and a projector and screen for readings or hymn lyrics if the venue wants one displayed.

We do not provide live streaming, broadcast cameras or interactive touch screens: none of these are part of our catalog. We also do not supply an LED video wall; the screen included in our packages is a single projection screen, not a wall display. Multilingual interpretation is not equipment we stock ourselves, but we can arrange it for your service through a subcontracted partner.

