## FAQs

### What AV equipment do I need for a religious event?

A microphone for the officiant, PA sound sized to the room, and a screen for readings or hymn lyrics if the venue wants one. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) and [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) cover these needs at different guest counts. See [Match Your Religious Event to a Package](#match-your-religious-event-to-a-package) above.

### How much does audio visual rental cost for a religious event?

Pricing depends on the package: our full catalog, from the Basic MICE Pack up to the Wedding Pack for a church ceremony, is listed with exact euro pricing on our [packages page](/packages/). All rates are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and every price includes delivery, setup and teardown.

### Do you provide a sound system for a church service?

Yes, the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) includes a gooseneck microphone for the lectern and PA sound reinforcement for up to 40 guests.

### What is included for a wedding ceremony in a church?

The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) includes a wireless handheld microphone for vows and readings, PA sound, and a technician on site to manage sound during the ceremony, for up to 80 guests.

### Is a technician included for a religious event?

It depends on the package. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) offers a technician as an add on; the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) includes one on site.

### Do you provide live streaming for religious services?

No, we do not provide cameras, streaming or broadcast equipment. Our setup covers the room's sound, microphone and screen.

### Do you provide interactive screens or multilingual interpretation technology?

Interactive touch screens, no: our screen and projector are for displaying readings or hymn lyrics, not an interactive display. Multilingual interpretation, yes as an arranged service: we don't stock the hardware ourselves, but we can bring in a subcontracted partner on request.

### How many microphones are included?

The Basic MICE Pack includes 1 gooseneck microphone. The Wedding Pack includes 1 wireless handheld microphone. If your event needs more than one, let us know when you book.

### How far in advance should I book AV equipment for a religious event?

Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability. For a ceremony with a fixed date, book as early as you can once your venue is confirmed. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.
